      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/539-wire-tabs (wire open runs #1109, burnout #540: keep both sides)\n\nWireParams/WireContourOp/WireJob/WireVerdict carry both the tab fields\n(tabs, capture, cutoff_from, held, captured) and main's (stock,\nclearance, burnout, skipped). The slug scan keeps main's open-run and\ncore arms inside the PR's per-height scan; the hold law's capture check\nskips a burnout. Tabs on an open run or a burnout are refused by name.\nMain's fixtures that free a slug state capture: true.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
