      "message": "test(wire): pin the stamp digest of every tab word and the cut-off wire and gap\n\nM3's review of #1158: removing the tabs block in params' stamp_with\nwire arm, or the cut-off condition's wire and gap in\nwire_op::stamp_condition, left every suite green. The new\nwire_stamp::every_tab_word_and_the_cut_off_wire_and_gap_move_the_stamp\nchanges each alone (count, width, a position's x and y, one more\nposition, the cut-off condition id - C130 states C120's wire and gap -\nand the cut-off condition's wire or gap) and asserts the stamp moves.\nAlso gives the #1370 fixture's literal this branch's tabs and capture\nfields (main's wire_stamp.rs met #539's WireContourOp in the merge).\n\nRefs #539\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
