      "message": "fix(wire): refuse tabs combined with a taper by name\n\nThe tapered builder reads the top-plane path as one closed ring; a\ntabbed path is not one. A 2 degree taper with two tabs was refused only\nby accident (the retrace's 180 degree turn ran the mitre away). Refuse\nthe pair by name at the command door (wire_gate: create, paste, edit)\nand in the generator next to the taper-with-burnout refusal.\n\nPinned by wire_tabs::tabs_with_a_taper_are_refused_by_name_at_every_door.\n\nRefs #539\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
